        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"b2b-ordering-guide\" aria-label=\"Boka Pro ordering guide\">\n  <style>\n    .b2b-ordering-guide {\n      --b2b-ink: #222721;\n      --b2b-forest: #737c5b;\n      --b2b-sage: #a5bc8b;\n      --b2b-frost: #e6f4d4;\n      --b2b-cream: #fafaf5;\n      --b2b-white: #ffffff;\n      --b2b-terracotta: #aa7a6b;\n      --b2b-line: rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.10);\n      --b2b-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.055);\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: var(--b2b-ink);\n      padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px) 0;\n      font-family: var(--font-body-family), \"Neue Haas Unica W1G\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide,\n    .b2b-ordering-guide * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__wrap {\n      width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 44px));\n      margin-inline: auto;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__panel {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid var(--b2b-line);\n      border-radius: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 32px);\n      padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 46px);\n      background: #ffffff;\n      box-shadow: var(--b2b-shadow);\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__header {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(320px, 1fr);\n      gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);\n      align-items: end;\n      margin-bottom: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 40px);\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__heading {\n      max-width: 620px;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--b2b-ink);\n      font-family: var(--font-heading-family), var(--font-body-family), Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 64px);\n      font-weight: 300;\n      letter-spacing: -0.055em;\n      line-height: 0.98;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__copy {\n      max-width: 640px;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.68);\n      font-size: clamp(15px, 1.25vw, 18px);\n      font-weight: 300;\n      line-height: 1.62;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__cards {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__card {\n      min-width: 0;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.09);\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      padding: 22px 20px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.035);\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__icon {\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      width: 46px;\n      height: 46px;\n      margin: 0 0 16px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--b2b-frost);\n      color: var(--b2b-forest);\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      color: var(--b2b-ink);\n      font-size: clamp(17px, 1.45vw, 21px);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n    }\n\n    .b2b-ordering-guide__card p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: rgba(34, 39, 33, 0.64);\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      font-weight: 300;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1020px) {\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__header {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        align-items: start;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__cards {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 680px) {\n      .b2b-ordering-guide {\n        padding: 32px 0;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__wrap {\n        width: min(100% - 28px, 1280px);\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__panel {\n        padding: 24px 16px;\n        border-radius: 22px;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__header {\n        gap: 16px;\n        margin-bottom: 22px;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__heading {\n        font-size: clamp(34px, 10.5vw, 46px);\n        line-height: 1;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__copy {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        line-height: 1.55;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__cards {\n        gap: 10px;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__card {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr);\n        column-gap: 14px;\n        align-items: start;\n        padding: 16px;\n        border-radius: 18px;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__icon {\n        grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n        width: 42px;\n        height: 42px;\n        margin: 0;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__card h3 {\n        margin-bottom: 6px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n      }\n\n      .b2b-ordering-guide__card p {\n        font-size: 13px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <div class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__wrap\">\n    <div class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__panel\">\n      <div class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__header\">\n        <h2 class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__heading\">Boka Dental Pros</h2>\n\n        <p class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__copy\">\n          Shop eligible products below using your approved Boka Pro account. Most products start at a minimum order quantity, with additional savings available when you order more.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__cards\">\n        <article class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__card\">\n          <span class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__icon\">20</span>\n          <h3>Minimum quantity</h3>\n          <p>\n            Most eligible products begin at a 20-unit minimum, though select multipacks or specialty products may vary.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__card\">\n          <span class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__icon\">50+</span>\n          <h3>50 / 100 unit price breaks</h3>\n          <p>\n            Many products unlock better per-unit pricing at 50 units, with the strongest price breaks often available at 100 units.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__card\">\n          <span class=\"b2b-ordering-guide__icon\">✓</span>\n          <h3>Checkout online</h3>\n          <p>\n            Add products to cart, review your professional pricing, and place your order directly through your Boka Pro account.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
